# 🚀 Relativistic Travel Simulator

> *"You are a space traveler. Choose your destination, set your speed. The universe calculates the rest."*

## Overview

A Python simulation of space travel based on Einstein's Special Theory of Relativity (1905).
The program receives a space destination and a velocity as a fraction of the speed of light, then calculates the relativistic effects of the journey: time dilation, space contraction, and relativistic kinetic energy.

